Karkov, whom the Weft call Kharkov, is a human [[Bestiary/Realmtouched#Duskwalker|Duskwalker]] in [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oresk]]. He is an older man with blue skin, and he wears the deep blue uniform of the [[Org/Althane/The First House|First House]]. Legions of people who agree with him follow him. He has taken all three of the [[Divinity/Thessians|Thessian]] bloods at once, which makes him more powerful.

He stands high in the First House, at a desk with a dossier on the Weft open in front of him, and he keeps two lieutenants close: the elven woman called [[People/Althane/The Slipseer|the Slipseer]] and the orc [[People/Althane/Rampart|Rampart]]. He has a strong interest in finding the Weft, who made themselves known to him once when they were weak and then vanished from his sight.

The Weft knew Karkov as a coworker, and hold that he does what he believes is best for everyone.
